sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as Drone (camera + telemetry)
  participant P as SecurityPipeline
  participant A as FrameAnalyzer
  participant T as EntityTracker
  participant R as Rules
  participant M as AlertManager
  participant I as FrameIndex
  participant C as SecurityMemory
  D->>P: Telemetry(ts, lat, lon, alt, battery, wind)
  P->>R: safety checks
  R-->>M: AlertCandidate? (e.g. battery 13%)
  D->>P: Frame 723 · 12:00 · "Blue Ford F150 at garage"
  P->>A: analyze(frame)
  A-->>P: [Detection(vehicle, blue, Ford, F150, truck, zone=garage)]
  P->>T: update(detection)
  T-->>P: entity vehicle-002, visit 2, dwell, zone_changed
  P->>P: log "Blue Ford F150 spotted at garage, 12:00."
  P->>R: evaluate(detection, track update)
  R-->>M: candidates (repeat_vehicle on new visit)
  M-->>P: Alert (after dedup / cooldown / escalation)
  P->>I: add_frame + detections + logs + alerts (batched)
  P->>C: observe_frame (hourly episode, recent logs, alerts)
